ow POI and road labels along a route."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"role":"article","abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","kind":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/DDSCircleLayerExample":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/ddscirclelayerexample","title":"Vector Tile Sources","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add and style a vector tile source"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/DDSCircleLayerExample","role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"https://maplibre.org/maplibre-style-spec/sources/":{"url":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/sources\/","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"tile source type","type":"text"}],"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/sources\/","title":"tile source type"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/WebAPIDataExample":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/webapidataexample","title":"Showing data from an API","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Showing data from an API with custom styling and interaction"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"title":"MapLibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentat